# Deny everything, then admit only what belongs in version control.
#
# knowledge/ is the estate's memory: checkpoints, ledgers, session records and
# the founder's own words. It stays on this disk and goes to the estate's own
# offsite bucket. It does not go to a code-hosting vendor. Founder, 2026-08-23:
# "this shold not be ingithub".
*
!.gitignore
!guards/
!guards/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
# Build products are a copy of something already tracked (LAW 24), and a committed
# __pycache__ is how a stale .pyc outlives the source it was built from.
scripts/**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
# The launchd plists are load-bearing: they are the only record of what runs on a
# schedule and when. Measured 2026-08-24 -- com.estate.inventory was written straight
# into ~/Library/LaunchAgents where no repository would ever have shown its diff, which
# is exactly the class LAW 24 names. The plists are committed here and installed by copy.
!launchagents/
!launchagents/**
state/inventory.json
!tests/
!tests/*.py
